oncern for others. Also note concerns: egocentric, difficulty communicating, low willingness to further education, but argue they are manageable.\n\nAlso bring up A and D: note that A's unorganized and unfriendly, D's moody and weak leadership, making them less suitable.\n\nThus our contribution: we support C, explain why, and note that A and D are less suitable.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\"."}
